{
  "changelog": "**alibabacloud-dataworks-datastudio-develop v0.0.3 - Major update with new data integration docs, stricter CLI/plugin requirements, and plugin-mode enforcement**\n\n- Switched all DataWorks CLI usage to plugin-mode (kebab-case) with explicit plugin installation and version checks (no more PascalCase RPC direct).\n- Updated all documentation and rules to require `aliyun plugin install --names dataworks-public` and verified Aliyun CLI >= 3.3.3 before any command.\n- Added and expanded Data Integration (DI) node type docs, including dozens of new reference files for supported datasources.\n- Replaced and removed legacy/incorrect DI references (removed 5 obsolete docs, added 113 new/updated ones).\n- Improved credential handling/requirements; do not search for local config\u2014rely on CLI-configured profiles only.\n- Clarified and simplified required FlowSpec and command formats, emphasizing use of canonical JSON structures and command flag patterns.",
  "created_at": 1775030712874,
